            <ArticleTitle>Lipid management among coronary artery disease patients with diabetes mellitus or advanced age.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>646-9, A10</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Aggressive lipid management is likely beneficial for coronary artery disease patients with diabetes mellitus or of advanced age. Nevertheless, a study of a large national sample of patients seen in ambulatory medical practices suggests pharmacologic undertreatment in these high-risk groups.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
